# Docker

Source: [awesome-cursorrules docker.mdc](https://github.com/PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules/blob/main/rules/docker.mdc) — aligned with this project's `Dockerfile` / compose.

## Dockerfile

- Pin base images (this repo: `python:3.13-slim`); avoid `:latest` in production
- Layer cache: copy `requirements.txt` → `pip install` → copy source
- `USER` non-root before `CMD` (this repo: `appuser` uid 10001)
- `HEALTHCHECK` on services that expose HTTP
- `COPY --chown=appuser:appuser` for app files

## Security

- Never run as root in production
- No secrets in Dockerfile, build args, or image layers
- Keep `.env` out of the image (`.dockerignore`)

## Compose / runtime

- Named volumes for persistence (`/data`, Postgres data)
- Logs to stdout/stderr only
- Reference services by compose service name
